  // Uniqueness is conditional on "not soft-deleted" — Prisma has no
  // declarative partial-unique-index syntax, so this is added as raw SQL in
  // the migration (see migration.sql's trailing CREATE UNIQUE INDEX).
  //
  // Identity used to resolve/upsert a Company (see ProspectIdentityResolver):
  // no externalId/RUT/corporate-domain column exists on this model today, so
  // (organizationId, clientId, normalizedName) — already this index — is the
